msgid ""
"You can selectively register `AccessTokenRequestReactiveFilter` by using "
"either `io.quarkus.oidc.token.propagation.common.AccessToken` or `org."
"eclipse.microprofile.rest.client.annotation.RegisterProvider` annotation, "
